{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09495","headline":"乐燕行 · 韦应物","name":"乐燕行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良辰且燕乐，乐往不再来。\n赵瑟正高张，音响清尘埃。\n一弹和妙讴，吹去绕瑶台。\n艳云凌空散，舞罗起徘徊。\n辉辉发衆颜，灼灼叹令才。\n当喧既无寂，中饮亦停杯。\n华灯何遽升，驰景忽西颓。\n高节亦云立，安能滞不回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}